    "detailed_description": "This is a divination simulator created using the principles of the ancient Chinese I Ching, a method of divination with a history of 5000 years in China. It enables the use of two ancient and mystical Chinese methods of divination: &quot;Numerical Divination&quot; and &quot;Hexagram Divination,&quot; to obtain an auspicious, inauspicious, or neutral outcome for inquiries held in mind. Additionally, we have integrated an AI fortune-telling feature, allowing you to ask questions related to ancient Chinese metaphysics such as &quot;Bazi&quot; and &quot;I Ching,&quot; or modern metaphysical subjects like &quot;astrology&quot; and &quot;MBTI,&quot; among any other metaphysical topics you're interested in. The AI master will provide detailed answers to each of your questions.",
    "about_the_game": "This is a divination simulator created using the principles of the ancient Chinese I Ching, a method of divination with a history of 5000 years in China. It enables the use of two ancient and mystical Chinese methods of divination: &quot;Numerical Divination&quot; and &quot;Hexagram Divination,&quot; to obtain an auspicious, inauspicious, or neutral outcome for inquiries held in mind. Additionally, we have integrated an AI fortune-telling feature, allowing you to ask questions related to ancient Chinese metaphysics such as &quot;Bazi&quot; and &quot;I Ching,&quot; or modern metaphysical subjects like &quot;astrology&quot; and &quot;MBTI,&quot; among any other metaphysical topics you're interested in. The AI master will provide detailed answers to each of your questions.",
    "short_description": "This divination simulator, grounded in the ancient I Ching principles, offers traditional Chinese &quot;Numerical&quot; and &quot;Hexagram Divination&quot; methods. With an AI feature, it answers queries on both ancient metaphysics and modern topics like astrology and MBTI, catering to diverse mystical interests",
